    "body": "`EncryptedKey.encrypt` passes caller keys to `Cipher.init`. During app execution, I observed that a key’s origin did not satisfy the CipherSpec rule’s accepted key origins.\n\nI added a regression test using a `SecretKeyFactory`-derived caller key, then encrypting and decrypting it through `EncryptedKey`. The test verifies that the original key material and algorithm survive the round trip, preserving existing encryption and decryption behavior while covering this key source.\n\nI also added a test for it (`EncryptedKeyTest.java`). The project builds with this change (`:mobile:assembleDebugAndroidTest`).\n\nI'm a Computer Engineering student at the University of Brasília (UnB), working on a research project on Android app analysis. Happy to adjust this to the project's conventions.",
